OL,4,BRaheem Sterling - from national icon   
OL,5,Bto suspended jail sentence             
OL,6,GRaheem Sterling grew up a stone's      
OL,7,Gthrow from Wembley Stadium, and went   
OL,8,Gon to start a European Championship    
OL,9,Gfinal for England there.               
OL,11,FAt his peak, the four-time Premier     
OL,12,FLeague winner was earning #325,000 a   
OL,13,Fweek at Chelsea.                       
OL,15,F"Raheem is a huge player with a huge   
OL,16,Finfluence in the last few years in     
OL,17,FEnglish football," said then Blues     
OL,18,Fboss Thomas Tuchel when he signed a 27-
OL,19,Fyear-old Sterling in a #50m deal in    
OL,20,F2022.                                  
